## discovery
- discoverAdapters in adapters/index.ts implements ngb by using filename filter (excludes .test.ts/types/index + non-.ts) + shape guard (bad mod filter: only add if default adapter && .name && typeof .fetch==='function') and cleanly handles readdir errors (return empty Map) + per-file import errors (console.warn + skip); covered by regression test in index.test.ts (bad mod filter edges) @implemented
- adapters/discovery > direct TDD tests in index.test.ts for readdir error (returns empty Map + emits warn for observability), import error (warn+skip on bad/nonexistent .ts), .ts filter (excludes .test.ts/excluded/non-.ts) + only valid shape adapters added; strengthens ud8/ngb with direct (mock readdir) edge coverage beyond indirect (TDD test-first + quality warn in catch) @implemented
- discoverAdapters bad mod filter (shape guard: after successful import, only add if default && .name && typeof fetch==='function') skips non-conforming modules + emits 'bad mod filter' warn for observability/quality (previously silent); covered by direct TDD test in index.test.ts exercising mocked bad shape (per ngb/ud8 shape guard + jru direct coverage) @implemented
- discoverAdapters catches dynamic import errors for bad/missing .ts modules listed by readdir (e.g. nonexistent), emits console.warn with 'failed to load adapter' + 'import error' prefix for clarity/quality + filename + err details, filters/skips the bad one (not added to returned Map), does not crash (other valid adapters still discovered); dedicated direct TDD test in index.test.ts for pure import error path (distinct from readdir/shape cases) per ngb discovery contract (strengthens jru/ud8/4qd direct coverage) @implemented
- duplicate name handling in ngb discovery: when readdir lists multiple .ts modules exporting adapters claiming the same .name, discoverAdapters emits console.warn 'duplicate adapter name "..." from <file> (overwriting previous; check for name clashes at runtime vs config names)' and the Map entry is overwritten by the last one (size remains 1 for name); covered by dedicated direct TDD test in adapters/index.test.ts exercising mocked dup modules + readdir @implemented
- adapters/discovery > direct TDD test in index.test.ts for no-default-export (default===undefined after successful import) bad mod filter edge: emits 'bad mod filter' warn + skips (extends shape guard observability/quality for this silent-skip path per ngb/ud8/4qd; previously no warn emitted unlike default-present bad shapes); covered by dedicated it() exercising mocked no-default module + readdir @implemented
- adapters/discovery > direct TDD test in index.test.ts for non-string .name (e.g. number) bad mod filter edge in shape guard: rejects (emits 'bad mod filter' warn + skips, not added) per ngb root '.name (string)' contract in types (current truthy-only .name check in ud8/4qd/qea would wrongly accept such modules); covered by dedicated it() exercising mocked non-string-name module + readdir list @implemented
- adapters/discovery > direct TDD test in index.test.ts for whitespace-only .name (e.g. ' ') bad mod filter edge in shape guard: rejects (emits 'bad mod filter' warn + skips, not added) per ngb root '.name (string)' contract intent (current truthy-only .name check in ud8/4qd/qea/8cf would wrongly accept ws-only names); covered by dedicated it() exercising mocked ws-name module + readdir list @implemented
- adapters/discovery > discoverAdapters shape guard rejects padded (leading/trailing ws) .name (e.g. ' padded-50 ', trim truthy but name !== trimmed) emitting 'bad mod filter' warn + skipping (not added to Map, prevents dirty keys); extends 4qd/8cf/q5f per ngb root '.name (string)' contract intent (current guard accepts -> bug); covered by dedicated direct TDD it() in adapters/index.test.ts (test-first for this remaining ngb discovery edge) @implemented
- adapters/discovery > discoverAdapters shape guard requires plain object default export (rejects function/class-ctor defaults even if .name string clean + .fetch fn props attached); emits 'bad mod filter' warn + skips (not added to Map) per ngb root 'default object with .name (string) and .fetch' contract intent (current 'adapter &&' accepts fn -> bug/pollution); covered by dedicated direct TDD it() in adapters/index.test.ts (test-first for this remaining ngb discovery edge) @implemented
- adapters/discovery > discoverAdapters filename filter skips dotfile .ts (files starting with '.') early (before import/shape) + no warn/no add to Map even for conforming shapes; extends jru/ud8/ngb (current endsWith .ts only allows dots like .dot.ts to be treated as adapters); covered by dedicated direct TDD it() in adapters/index.test.ts (test-first for this remaining ngb discovery edge) @implemented
- adapters/discovery > discoverAdapters shape guard requires plain object default export (rejects class *instances* even if .name string clean + .fetch fn attached to instance); emits 'bad mod filter' warn + skips (not added to Map) per ngb root 'default object' + 0od 'plain object' contract intent (current object check accepts inst -> bug); covered by dedicated direct TDD it() in adapters/index.test.ts (test-first for this remaining ngb discovery edge) @implemented
- adapters/discovery > discoverAdapters filename filter case-sens .ts/.test.ts edge (mixed-case *.TEST.ts leaks past endsWith check, treated as adapter; per ngb 'scans src/adapters/*.ts' excludes tests/types/index): covered by dedicated direct TDD it() in index.test.ts (test-first for this remaining ngb discovery edge after ydz/f69/0od) @implemented

